Recommends: qt6-svg-plugins
Description: flexible QtQuick based desktop shell toolkit
 Quickshell is a toolkit for building status bars, widgets, lock screens and
 other desktop components with QtQuick. It is the runtime of the SOS Shell.
 .
 Built by SOS from a pinned upstream release. Quickshell uses private Qt
 APIs, so this package is tied to the exact Qt release it was built with.
